A6L audfix (24 Sep 2026): q6routing keeps one routing session per MultiMedia FE *and direction*.
Fixes "qcom-q6adm: cmd = 0x10325 return error = 0x2" (ADM_CMD_MATRIX_MAP_ROUTINGS_V5 EBADPARAM) when a FE is routed
to an RX BE and a TX BE at the same time (MultiMedia1 full duplex). Apply with: cd <kernel> && patch -p1 < this file

